  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ポケモンの　ロトムが\nモーターに　はいったことで\nターボが　できるようになった　じてんしゃ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "포켓몬 로토무가\n모터에 들어가서\n터보를 사용할 수 있게 된 자전거.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "由於寶可夢洛托姆\n進入了這輛自行車的馬達中，\n使得它變得可以進行渦輪加速。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Motisma est entré dans le moteur de cette bicyclette\nà assistance électrique et permet désormais de mettre\nle turbo.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ein Fahrrad mit einem Motor, in dem sich ein Rotom\nbefindet. Dank des Rotom-Turbos erreicht das Rad\nabsolute Spitzengeschwindigkeiten.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una bicicleta en la que puede activarse el turbo, al\nllevar al Pokémon Rotom incorporado en el motor.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una bicicletta che permette di mettere il turbo\ngrazie al Rotom che è entrato nel suo motore.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "This bike can be combined with the Pokémon Rotom to\nuse a turbo boost.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "ポケモンの　ロトムが\nモーターに　入ったことで\nターボが　できるようになった　じてんしゃ。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "宝可梦洛托姆潜入马达后，\n这辆自行车变得可以\n通过涡轮发动机加速了。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Una bicicleta en la que puede activarse el turbo, al\nllevar al Pokémon Rotom incorporado en el motor.",
      "version_group": {
